  m_text: And here we are ... I have to go to the majestic and mysterious forest
    because some Lady said so. How stupid and naive. However, if that Lady wasn't
    lying and I really get a chance to talk to those whom everyone is used to idolizing...
    It's worth the risk. In the worst case, I'll just waste my time on a meaningless
    walk in the forest.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
